Z||000000||MinnGreenGT||11-07-2001||03:28 PM||||Ok, I've been digging around for quite some time now looking for a set of nice wheels.  I still very much like the stock-style wheels, I'd just like something similiar in a 17" wheel and possibly a little wider in the back.  I know that BBS <B>used</B> to make them, but they no longer do- the style has changed.  Also, I really like the slightly deeper dish, as opposed to flush looking rims.  Any suggestions?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/nissan-gtp.jpg"> <BR>Nissan GTP w/Gold Wheels (I know they're too big...)<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firebird6.jpg"> <BR>These are the Firebird GTA Gold Wheels.  Right Style but still only 16" (and wrong bolt pattern).<BR><P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||5
