Z||000003||Raydar||11-07-2001||05:24 PM||||Check out <A HREF="http://www.aaarims.com" TARGET=_blank>www.aaarims.com</A>  <P>I know you want 17s, but maybe this will be useful.<P>The early 90s Grand Prix had a 16x8 wheel that looked like the GT wheel. <BR>The Bonneville had a 16x7 wheel that was identical, other than the size, and the paint color. <BR>Of course, these were 5x115 wheels. <BR>If I can ever figure out a reasonable way to change bolt circles, these are what I'm going to get.<P><P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
